  <div class="modal-sheet">
    <div class="m-handle"></div>
    <div class="m-title">API Key 設定</div>
    <div class="m-desc">設定後自動儲存，下次無需重新輸入。<br><a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials" target="_blank">前往 Google Cloud 申請</a></div>
    <input class="m-input" type="password" id="apiKeyInput" placeholder="AIzaSy..."/>
